        12
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Ursyn%C3%B3w%2C_Kozienice_County"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "In the 1970s, Ursynów’s first grocery shop opened in the building that now houses the Ursynów Museum, a pre‑war structure.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        28,
        29
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
