      ],
      "source": "https://go2warsaw.pl/en/walk-around-ursynow-district/"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "Ursynów’s 1970s prefabricated blocks were set far apart, forming green “islands” that keep cars out of the living areas.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        21,
